bake-coding-agent includes code ported from the following projects, each under
the license reproduced below. Bake's own changes are under the workspace's MIT
license.

================================================================================
Pi (packages/coding-agent)
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Release v1.1.0, revision abe508e1b89912adde45528136c3221eb69acdd7.
Ported: the session manager (src/core/session-manager.ts), the session
working-directory checks (src/core/session-cwd.ts), the coding-agent message
types and converters (src/core/messages.ts), the path helpers the session
manager uses (src/utils/paths.ts), Pi's UUIDv7 generator
(packages/ai/src/utils/uuid.ts), and the session-manager tests under test/;
tool-output truncation and accumulation (src/core/tools/truncate.ts, output-accumulator.ts), exclusive
output files (src/utils/output-files.ts), and the output cases of
test/tools.test.ts and test/mcp-extension.test.ts;
file-mutation ordering (src/core/tools/file-mutation-queue.ts) and
test/file-mutation-queue.test.ts, whose callback cancellation pattern follows
src/core/tools/write.ts and edit.ts;
the headless agent session (src/core/agent-session.ts, src/core/sdk.ts), the
system prompt (src/core/system-prompt.ts) and context-file loading
(src/core/resource-loader.ts), the model registry and resolver
(src/core/model-runtime.ts, provider-composer.ts, model-config.ts,
model-resolver.ts), credential reading (src/core/auth-storage.ts), config
values (src/core/resolve-config-value.ts), settings
(src/core/settings-manager.ts), print mode and its JSON events
(src/modes/print-mode.ts, json-event.ts), the command line (src/main.ts,
src/cli/args.ts, src/cli/initial-message.ts), JSON comment stripping
(src/utils/json.ts), the login guidance (src/core/auth-guidance.ts), the
file tools (src/core/tools/read.ts, write.ts, edit.ts, edit-diff.ts, ls.ts,
find.ts, grep.ts, path-utils.ts, index.ts, tool-definition-wrapper.ts), the
tool selection of src/core/settings-manager.ts, sdk.ts, agent-session.ts, and
mcp-servers.ts, the image helpers (src/utils/mime.ts, exif-orientation.ts,
image-convert.ts, image-resize-core.ts, image-resize.ts, image-process.ts,
tool-result-images.ts), the bash tool and its process handling
(src/core/tools/bash.ts, src/core/exec.ts, src/utils/shell.ts, src/utils/child-process.ts,
BASH_UPDATE_THROTTLE_MS from src/core/tools/renderers/bash.ts), compaction
(src/core/compaction/compaction.ts, branch-summarization.ts, utils.ts) with
auto-compaction and auto-retry from src/core/agent-session.ts, and the tests
under test/ that the Rust tests name. From release v1.2.0, revision
06a466935536f8c9bcacb2d5efc0fc021be1bdff: skills (src/core/skills.ts,
src/utils/frontmatter.ts, the .agents skill discovery of
src/core/package-manager.ts, and the skill-command expansion of
src/core/agent-session.ts), the linked-worktree fix of
src/core/resource-loader.ts, Pi's skill fixtures under
test/fixtures/skills and test/fixtures/skills-collision, and the settings and
credential writes: the locked file backends and global-scope setters of
src/core/settings-manager.ts and src/core/auth-storage.ts, the runtime-key
overlay of src/core/runtime-credentials.ts, and the cases of
test/auth-storage.test.ts, test/runtime-credentials.test.ts,
test/settings-manager.test.ts, and test/settings-manager-bug.test.ts that the
Rust tests name; the steering and follow-up queue of src/core/agent-session.ts
(steer, followUp, _queueUserInput, _queueSteer, _queueFollowUp, clearQueue,
_emitQueueUpdate, and the queue bookkeeping on message_start), its
queue_update event, and its pre-prompt model and API-key check.
The queue-mode and pre-message_start bookkeeping cases of
test/suite/agent-session-queue.test.ts are adapted in agent_session/tests.rs;
extension-command, input-handler, and custom-message cases remain deferred.
Also from v1.2.0: the session controls of src/core/agent-session.ts
(setModel, setThinkingLevel, setSteeringMode, setFollowUpMode, and
_installAgentNextTurnRefresh, the next request reading the current model),
the model runtime's snapshot and update of src/core/model-runtime.ts, and the
cases of those files' tests that agent_session/control_tests.rs and
model_registry/tests.rs name. Also from v1.2.0: setSessionName, its
session_info_changed event, and getSessionStats of src/core/agent-session.ts,
with regression tests
test/suite/regressions/5996-session-name-newlines.test.ts and
test/suite/regressions/3686-session-name-event.test.ts adapted in
agent_session/control_tests.rs (their extension variants are not adapted);
and the session construction of src/core/agent-session-runtime.ts
(newSession and switchSession building the next session) adapted in
src/cli/mod.rs as SessionFactory. Also from v1.2.0, tree navigation and
forking: navigateTree (without branch summaries or extension events),
getUserMessagesForForking, and the leaf rules and context refresh of
src/core/agent-session.ts, adapted in agent_session/navigation.rs; and the
runtime fork of src/core/agent-session-runtime.ts (its default position
before a user message, createBranchedSession and newSession with a parent
session) adapted in agent_session/navigation.rs, session/manager.rs
(branched_copy), and src/cli/mod.rs (SessionFactory::fork). Cases of
test/agent-session-tree-navigation.test.ts,
test/agent-session-branching.test.ts,
test/suite/regressions/tree-during-streaming.test.ts,
test/suite/regressions/9178-tree-during-compaction.test.ts, and
test/suite/regressions/8724-in-memory-fork-active-tool.test.ts are adapted
in agent_session/navigation_tests.rs.
Also from v1.2.0, session search: src/modes/interactive/components/
session-selector-search.ts (parseSearchQuery, matchSession,
filterAndSortSessions, hasSessionName, without the threaded sort), adapted in
src/session/search.rs, with the cases of
test/session-selector-search.test.ts in src/session/search_tests.rs; and the
fuzzy matching of packages/tui/src/fuzzy.ts (fuzzyMatch, fuzzyFilter) in
src/cli/list_models.rs, with the cases of packages/tui/test/fuzzy.test.ts.
Also from v1.2.0, interactive compaction: src/core/agent-session.ts (compact,
abortCompaction, and the prompt's refusal during compaction), adapted as
AgentSession::compact_when_idle in src/agent_session.rs and
src/agent_session/recovery.rs, with cases of
test/agent-session-compaction.test.ts,
test/suite/regressions/7150-rpc-prompt-during-compaction.test.ts, and
test/suite/regressions/9340-9777-auto-compaction-cancellation.test.ts in
src/agent_session/idle_compaction_tests.rs.
From release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0:
the orphaned tool-call rule of transformMessages
(packages/ai/src/api/transform-messages.ts, its second pass), adapted as the
unanswered-call projection in src/session/unanswered.rs.

From release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0, the
tool-call veto: ExtensionRunner.emitToolCall in
src/core/extensions/runner.ts (handlers in order, the first block returned)
and AgentSession._beforeToolCall in src/core/agent-session.ts (a failing
handler blocks the call), adapted in src/plugins/veto.rs and
src/agent_session/plugin_veto.rs; ToolCallEventResult in
src/core/extensions/types.ts, adapted as ToolCallVeto in src/plugins/mod.rs;
and examples/extensions/protected-paths.ts, ported as ProtectedPaths in
src/plugins/protected_paths.rs, with its cases in src/plugins/tests.rs and
src/agent_session/plugin_tests.rs.

From release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0, the
object disposal of packages/chord/src/object.ts (a memoized dispose that runs
whether or not a caller waits, aborting tasks before awaiting them), adapted
in src/owned_work.rs, with cases of packages/chord/test/host.test.ts (forced
disposal aborts in-flight calls) and test/review.test.ts (an aborted task
context cannot start fresh calls) in src/owned_work/tests.rs.

From release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0, the
MCP integration: the configuration of src/extensions/mcp/config.ts (the
mcpServers shape, server names, transports, exposures, timeouts, and its
messages), the connection and tool lifecycle of src/extensions/mcp/runtime.ts
and src/extensions/mcp/index.ts, the tool wrapping and result conversion of
src/extensions/mcp/tools.ts (convertMcpResult, toModelContent,
readableResources, binary resources saved to
files, and middle truncation), the resource tools of
src/extensions/mcp/resources.ts (list_mcp_resources,
list_mcp_resource_templates, and read_mcp_resource with their parameter and
output schemas, descriptions, payloads, and messages, isMcpAppResource,
listed, stringArgument, findServer, and jsonResult) with their registration
and the server instructions and mcp_servers section of
src/extensions/mcp/index.ts (serversWithResources, syncResourceTools,
registerTools, serverSummary, and renderServersSection) over the names of
src/core/mcp-servers.ts, and the startup wait and tool declaration of
src/core/mcp-servers.ts and src/core/agent-session.ts, adapted in src/mcp/,
with the cases of test/mcp-extension.test.ts and
test/suite/agent-session-mcp.test.ts that src/mcp/ and tests/mcp_session.rs
name.

From release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0, the
session export and bug report: the HTML export of src/core/export-html/
(index.ts's generateHtml, generateThemeVars, and deriveExportColors, and
template.html, template.css, and template.js, embedded verbatim with the
dark theme of src/modes/interactive/theme/dark.json resolved), in
src/export_html/; the branch serialization of src/core/session-export.ts and
createShareTrailingEntries of src/modes/interactive/session-share.ts, in
src/session_export.rs; the redaction, metadata, diagnostics, and files of
src/core/bug-report.ts and the archive layout of src/utils/zip.ts, in
src/bug_report.rs; and exportSessionToHtml's checks with buildBundle and
recordInSession of src/modes/interactive/bug-report.ts, in
src/agent_session/share.rs; with the cases of test/bug-report.test.ts,
test/export-jsonl-share.test.ts, and test/export-html-xss.test.ts that those
files name.

From release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0, RPC
mode: the command loop, commands, responses, and shutdown of
src/modes/rpc/rpc-mode.ts, the protocol records of
src/modes/rpc/rpc-types.ts, and the strict JSONL framing of
src/modes/rpc/jsonl.ts, adapted in src/rpc/; docs/rpc.md,
docs/rpc-commands.md, and docs/rpc-extension-ui.md as the protocol's
description; and the cases of test/rpc-jsonl.test.ts,
test/rpc-prompt-response-semantics.test.ts, test/rpc.test.ts,
test/rpc-client-clear-queue.test.ts, test/rpc-client-clone.test.ts, and
test/rpc-client-process-exit.test.ts that src/rpc/ and
crates/bake-cli/tests/rpc.rs name. Approvals (D24) are Bake's own, carried
over Pi's extension_ui_request.
